WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.049 --> 00:00:03.460
Who in the world is Admiral Greenbull?

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:06.680
How do his seemingly limitless powers work?

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:12.790
And will he turn out to be an enemy or ally
to Luffy's and the straw hats' cause?

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:17.439
We have been waiting for the reveal of this
man ever since Dressroa, where Doflamingo

00:00:17.439 --> 00:00:23.400
revealed that the Marines had drafted not
one, but two power houses for the vacant admiral

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.529
positions left by Aojiki and Akainu.

00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:32.059
And now, after many years of starving to see
what this man's powers look like, with Oda-sensei

00:00:32.059 --> 00:00:37.640
feeding us nothing but a silhouette or two
here and there, we finally have seen what

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:44.559
the third marine admiral next to Kizaru and
Fujitora looks like and is capable of.

00:00:44.559 --> 00:00:47.149
And my god is he capable.

00:00:47.149 --> 00:00:52.429
Now I can't be the only one who'd love to
be as strong and fight like Greenbull.

00:00:52.429 --> 00:00:56.829
And while I sadly don't have his devil fruit
for you to eat, I have today's sponsor to

00:00:56.829 --> 00:00:58.380
help you out with this.

00:00:58.380 --> 00:00:59.690
DNF Duel.

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:06.750
DNF Duel, is a new and exciting duelling fighting
game, that has just now released on PS4, PS5,

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:12.980
and PC - and it's packed with a lot of great
character design, lore, and more!

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:19.770
This game reworks 17 years of iconic Dungeon
and Fighter history into a whole new experience.

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:24.740
Even though I don't play a ton of fighting
games, it was super easy to pick up and get

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:25.740
obsessed with.

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:31.360
I really love the art style and the controls
feel incredibly intuitive.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:36.110
So if you also feel the urge to fight,
DNF Duel is now available on PS4, PS5, and

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:40.890
PC ,on Steam - check it out now using the
link in my description below.

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:46.910
Greenbull, or Aramaki, as he's actually called,
is a tall, muscular man with shoulder long

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:53.110
black hair, a pair of badass black shades
and smoking a cigarette, which funnily enough

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:56.390
goes against his otherwise 'green' image.

00:01:56.390 --> 00:02:01.410
He's refusing to wear a shirt under his admiral
coat, rightfully so, I wouldn't wear a shirt

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:07.480
either with that upper body, and he carries
an incredibly sleek looking Katana without

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:11.270
any sheath, but simply jammed into his belt.

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:18.080
He has a massive kanji tattoo on his chest,
in order: Death, River, Heart and Middle.

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:24.110
The last two kanji together read shinchuu,
which means double suicide committed by lovers.

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:28.530
But it can also mean one's true feelings or
true motives.

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:34.230
So I guess the tatoo reads something like
'lover's suicide on the river of death', while

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:41.600
it might also hint at Aramaki having hidden
motives compared to what he openly says.

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:46.380
I want you to remember that, because it will
be important in a second, when we talk about

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:47.920
Greenbull's true intentions.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:55.450
He also wears tight pants with a sakura motive
on them, going well with his plant powers.

00:02:55.450 --> 00:03:03.560
Now you will have noticed that Aramaki in
general has an incredibly Japanese vibe around

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:04.560
him.

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:09.130
Just like the actor Harada Yoshio who was
famous for his Ronin and Gangster roles, that

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:14.700
he is inspired by, I think Greenbull has pretty
strong Yakuza vibes.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:20.250
The straight blade, no shirt under a jacket,
the sun glasses and the cigarette.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:24.670
This is meant to be a classic Japanese gangster.

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:29.840
And it once again brings up a really interesting
and honestly important question that people

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:32.620
have been asking for quite a while now:

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:35.200
Is Aramaki from Wano?

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:39.770
Because while, the world of One PIece has
a lot of Japanese influence simply because

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:45.680
it's written by a Japanese author predominantly
for a Japanese audience, there is one place

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:51.990
in particular that is fully entered around
Edo Japan and Japanese culture, that even

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:55.540
has the Yakuza as an institution.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.920
And that place is Wano.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:04.490
This was also speculated for Fujitora, or
Issho, who also has an incredibly strong samurai

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:05.490
theme.

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:10.849
And as we know both of them not only got drafted
together, but they also seem to get along

00:04:10.849 --> 00:04:14.190
really well and talk like old friends.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:20.539
And what other place in One PIece could you
possible find such randomly powerful people

00:04:20.539 --> 00:04:26.460
to draft into an admiral position than Wano,
the one country the government has never dared

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:32.279
to attack because of its powerful warriors
and that even Akainu doesn't want to send

00:04:32.279 --> 00:04:33.379
troops to.

00:04:33.379 --> 00:04:39.330
Remember, the admirals are the most powerful
force the marines have at their disposal.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:44.499
The top tier fighters they have to face people
like Whitebeard or Shanks.

00:04:44.499 --> 00:04:50.570
The original 3 admirals were shaped into these
monsters over decades within the marines.

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:57.360
So drafting someone form the outside into
this highest of positions, really speaks for

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.449
their power.

00:04:58.449 --> 00:05:04.879
Oda has actually more or less confirmed in
an SBS that Fujitora and Greenbull share similarities

00:05:04.879 --> 00:05:09.289
and might have ulterior motives that go against
the world government.

00:05:09.289 --> 00:05:15.479
Both Issho and Aramaki have been ignoring
direct orders form Akainu multiple times and

00:05:15.479 --> 00:05:22.229
Fujitora even abolished the Warlord system
that was one of governments most prized balancing

00:05:22.229 --> 00:05:23.819
powers in the world.

00:05:23.819 --> 00:05:30.599
One very intriguing possibility is that Fujitora
or Ryokugyo or maybe both are former Daimyo

00:05:30.599 --> 00:05:37.309
or Yakuza bosses, that had left Wano before
or when Kaido took over the country.

00:05:37.309 --> 00:05:42.639
Some clues that people like my good friend
Mr Morj have found, actually suggested that

00:05:42.639 --> 00:05:49.490
Greenbull might have been Shimotsuki Ushimaru,
a man who has an actual bull on his coat as

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:55.560
his symbol and has the word ushi, which means
bull, in his name.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:06:01.889
By the way in the anime, the bull on the Ushimaru's
coat is literally green.

00:06:01.889 --> 00:06:07.809
The same Shimotsuki Ushimaru, that has now
been heavily suggested to be either Zoro's

00:06:07.809 --> 00:06:11.529
father or at least some sort of relative.

00:06:11.529 --> 00:06:17.089
One awesome example more brings up, is how
both Zoro and Ryokugyo are introduced as fasting,

00:06:17.089 --> 00:06:20.479
with both luffy and Zoro commenting on it.

00:06:20.479 --> 00:06:24.439
Ryukugyo says that he would only break his
fast for a pretty girl.

00:06:24.439 --> 00:06:30.490
And Zoro literally breaks his fast to eat
the little girls Onigiri, that Helmeppo has

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.419
made fun of and stomped on.

00:06:32.419 --> 00:06:33.419
Now.

00:06:33.419 --> 00:06:38.330
After knowing what Ryokugyo and Ushimaru looks
like, your first reaction might be the same

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:42.250
as mine: These two look nothing alike.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:44.710
At least that was genuinely my first impression.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:50.280
But then I took these two images of the two
and put them into photoshop.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.710
And you know what.

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:52.710
IT works.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:53.879
Like, do you see what I'm seeing?

00:06:53.879 --> 00:06:57.819
The eyebrows and eyes match up pretty much
perfectly.

00:06:57.819 --> 00:06:59.639
The nose is exactly the same.

00:06:59.639 --> 00:07:00.639
The teeth are exactly the same.

00:07:00.639 --> 00:07:05.219
His mouth not only has the same expression,
but even the cigarette and the grass straw

00:07:05.219 --> 00:07:07.729
are in the exact same position.

00:07:07.729 --> 00:07:13.569
The only real difference is the hairstyle,
that let's be real could be really easily

00:07:13.569 --> 00:07:14.569
changed.

00:07:14.569 --> 00:07:19.589
And don't forget that 20 years have passed
between that scene in the cave with Yamato

00:07:19.589 --> 00:07:20.589
and today.

00:07:20.589 --> 00:07:27.610
So, if I had to bet any money on who Admiral
Greenbull is, I would absolutely go with Shimotsuki

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:30.909
Ushimaru, who also is Zoro's father.

00:07:30.909 --> 00:07:36.849
And I think this would explain everything
we have seen from Greenbull so far absolutely

00:07:36.849 --> 00:07:37.849
perfectly.

00:07:37.849 --> 00:07:41.669
Of course he would come right back to wano
after Kaido's defeat.

00:07:41.669 --> 00:07:47.339
He and the other daimyo's tried fighting back
against Kaido and his armies but were defeated.

00:07:47.339 --> 00:07:52.229
He probably joined up with the marines in
the first place due to his hatred for pirates

00:07:52.229 --> 00:07:57.559
and what they did to his country, similar
to how Fujitora couldn't stand Doflamingo's

00:07:57.559 --> 00:07:59.349
unjust rule over dressrosa.

00:07:59.349 --> 00:08:04.840
They might have joined the marines to finally
defeat pirates like Kaido in the first place.

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:09.729
I actually think it's quite possible that
both Greenbull and Fujitora only got their

00:08:09.729 --> 00:08:15.879
respective devil fruits when they joined up
with the marines and were drafted as admirals.

00:08:15.879 --> 00:08:20.930
Greenbull ignoring Akainu's orders and coming
to Wano to see what's going on would be only

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:23.759
logical, if it's actually his home country.

00:08:23.759 --> 00:08:28.289
Not only would he want to make sure that the
beast pirates are taken care of for good,

00:08:28.289 --> 00:08:32.959
which is literally the very first thing he
does when arriving, but he would also want

00:08:32.959 --> 00:08:38.050
to make sure that no other pirate takes Kaido's
place, which is why he's planning to take

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:39.529
Luffy's head.

00:08:39.529 --> 00:08:44.750
He would want to see a free wano, not simply
one tyrant replaced by the next.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:50.279
Because as far as Aramaki knows, Luffy is
a wanted dangerous criminal.

00:08:50.279 --> 00:08:52.149
He hasn't met Luffy yet.

00:08:52.149 --> 00:08:56.889
Luffy, who now has a ridiculous bounty of
3 Billion berries.

00:08:56.889 --> 00:09:03.100
Very much unlike we here on this channel with
a bounty of 61 Million, 100 berries for each

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.100
subscriber.

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:10.350
So rather than becoming a YOnko, our big goal
is fighting hard to overtake the slimiest

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:15.300
man in all of One PIece, who for some reason
has a bounty of 99 million.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:22.220
Please go help me win this fierce race to
100M by hitting subscribe and getting freshly

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:25.209
baked One Piece content every single week.

00:09:25.209 --> 00:09:30.980
now, My biggest argument for Greenbull loving
Wano and hating the Beast pirates for what

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:35.410
they did however is this panel from chapter
1053.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:39.060
Where we see Udon Prison from afar.

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:43.220
Compare this to this panel here where we first
get introduced to the prison as it is surrounded

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:46.360
by a deadly wasteland.

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:52.310
Greenbull is literally reviving Wano and returning
all it's lushness and nature.

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:56.600
He uses all of the beast pirates energy to
rejuvenate Wano.

00:09:56.600 --> 00:10:01.900
ANd he's doing that to all of the country
as he's making his way form Udon to the flower

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:02.900
capital.

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:06.589
This isn't just a random side effect of his
powers.

00:10:06.589 --> 00:10:12.009
Because otherwise, we would have seen flowers
and plants spring up all around him on Marijois

00:10:12.009 --> 00:10:13.009
as well.

00:10:13.009 --> 00:10:19.520
No, this is Greenbull actively using all the
energy he has absorbed to do this.

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:27.420
And so the question is, what will happen,
once Greenbull actually reaches the capital?

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:32.410
Because I personally think, that he is quite
serious about taking Luffy's head.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:37.710
Aramaki seems to be no fan of the world government,
just like Fujitora, but that is also true

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:38.910
for Akainu as we know.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:43.310
There is a lot of movement inside the Marines
right now to reform and become independent

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:44.589
form the world government.

00:10:44.589 --> 00:10:50.060
Including people like Garp, Koby, X Drake,
but also the fleet admiral himself.

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:55.660
And so I think that Greenbull can be against
the world government, but still pro Akainu,

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:59.470
supporting his style of leadership and trying
to get his approval.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:01.910
This actually caught my interest as well.

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:05.040
As you might know, the admirals follow a very
interesting color scheme.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:09.899
You have the 3 primary colors, red, yellow
and blue, that you can use to mix any other

00:11:09.899 --> 00:11:10.899
color with.

00:11:10.899 --> 00:11:14.700
Mixing Red and Blue for instance gives us
Fujitora's purple.

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:20.720
And I think Fujitora's justice, is indeed
located somewhere between Akainu's red and

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:22.149
Aokiji's blue.

00:11:22.149 --> 00:11:27.259
Incredibly strict and merciless like Akainu,
but open to exceptions and reason, like in

00:11:27.259 --> 00:11:29.370
Luffy's case, similar to Aokiji.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:35.370
In that sense, Greenbull would be a mix between
Aokiji and Kizaru.

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:42.009
Incredibly powerful and destructive when unleashed,
but also pretty laid back and curious, like

00:11:42.009 --> 00:11:43.480
Kizaru was on Sabaody.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:50.420
This goes very well Greenbulls relaxed nature
that we saw on Marijois.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:56.170
Should Greenbull actually turn out to be Ushimari
however, in other words Zoro's father, that

00:11:56.170 --> 00:12:02.120
would instantly solve my one big issue with
the ending to wano so far: Zoro's unresolved

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:03.440
connection to the country.

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:09.420
So Greenbull's solo arrival at the flower
capital might very well be exactly that, Zoro

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:14.230
meeting his father and either learning about
his heritage or, he might already be aware

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:16.819
about it and simply recognise his father.

00:12:16.819 --> 00:12:21.040
Depending on how young he was when he got
separated form his parents.

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:26.380
I think an admiral crashing the party in the
capital, like Aokiji did during water 7, would

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:32.009
be epic enough by itself, but this sort of
connection would make it even better than

00:12:32.009 --> 00:12:34.040
it already is by itself.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:37.920
But let's also talk about Aramaki's powers
by themselves for a bit.

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:43.970
Because just how wood is incredibly overpowered
in the world of Naruto, they seem to be incredibly

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:45.410
overpowered here as well.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:50.970
Not only can Greenbull build any structure
with his powers, he is literally able to take

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:55.850
life energy and redistribute it by growing
plants of any type.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:59.560
This seems ridiculously powerful even by admiral
standards.

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:04.449
It also really makes me wonder what type of
devil fruit this is.

00:13:04.449 --> 00:13:10.000
My first reaction was to categorise this as
a paramecia or special paramecia fruit, being

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.820
able to generate plants with his body.

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:17.470
But at the same time, the fact, that he can
drink Sake though the roots and steal power

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:23.899
from others for himself almost makes it seem,
like his body might made from plants, as in

00:13:23.899 --> 00:13:27.019
he might be a plant logia fruit user.

00:13:27.019 --> 00:13:32.189
I'm just super curious to find out what his
actual devil fruit is called and categorised

00:13:32.189 --> 00:13:33.189
at.

00:13:33.189 --> 00:13:37.589
And of course find out more about his true
intentions and what he's like as a person.

00:13:37.589 --> 00:13:42.770
Since we just found out that Momo's grandfather,
Kozuki Sukiyaki is alive as well, if Greenbull

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:46.819
is a former Daimyo, he would surely recognise
him as well.

00:13:46.819 --> 00:13:50.910
No matter what way you look at it, Greenbulls
introduction, together with the reveal of

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:56.060
the new Yonko has changed the power dynamics
of the one piece world fundamentally.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:14:00.220
And if you wnat to understand what that means
for the future of the one piece world, you

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:03.459
really shouldnt miss this video right here.

